		(descr "RCA (phono) jack, right angle, through hole, Same Sky (CUI) RCJ-04x (RCJ-041 black ... RCJ-047 orange), https://www.sameskydevices.com/product/resource/rcj-04.pdf (rev 1.07). Origin: the body's front face on the jack's axis; the plug enters from -X. Pads numbered for KiCad's Conn_Coaxial: pad 1 = centre contact (datasheet terminal 2, 8.5 mm back), pad 2 = shell (datasheet terminal 1, 4 mm back). The two front locating feet go through 1.8 x 1.7 mm board cutouts (Edge.Cuts here): keep the board edge at least ~1.5 mm in front of the face so the cutouts stay closed.")
